$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Theta Draconis IV" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> On this abandoned world, grave of the Starslayer tribe, the <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle for the possession of their pyramid.  The Starslayers built this pyramid in honor of the Gods above.  They built a walkway to the heavens and placed a switch there so the Gods may have full control over their pyramid.  Now that both teams have established bases with a flag inside, they will fight for control of the 3-point pyramid!" @
         "\n\n<f1>Designed by: <f0> Pokey" @
         "\n\n<f1>Special Thanks: <f0> Thanks for an awesome map editor tutorial Earthworm (http://www.seatac.net/earthworm/)! Your work is much appreciated!";